	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Complète le tableau de signes de $B(x)=\\dfrac{ {{if:a==-1|-|}}{{if:a*a>1|{{a}}|}}x{{b;+}} }{ {{if:c==-1|-|}}{{if:c*c>1|{{c}}|}}x{{d;+}} }$.\n\n```variation\nvariable: x\ndomain: -inf, ?{{ra}}, ?{{rb}}, +inf\n\nsign: {{if:a==-1|-|}}{{if:a*a>1|{{a}}|}}x{{b;+}}\n  -inf,{{ra}}: ?{{if:a>0|-|+}}\n  {{ra}}: ?z\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: ?{{if:a>0|+|-}}\n  {{rb}},+inf: ?{{if:a>0|+|-}}\n  {{rb}}: ?rien\n\nsign: {{if:c==-1|-|}}{{if:c*c>1|{{c}}|}}x{{d;+}}\n  -inf,{{ra}}: ?{{if:c>0|-|+}}\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: ?{{if:c>0|-|+}}\n  {{rb}}: ?z\n  {{rb}},+inf: ?{{if:c>0|+|-}}\n  {{ra}}: ?rien\n\nsign: B(x)\n  -inf,{{ra}}: ?{{if:ac>0|+|-}}\n  {{ra}}: ?z\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: ?{{if:ac>0|-|+}}\n  {{rb}}: ?||\n  {{rb}},+inf: ?{{if:ac>0|+|-}}\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..3;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "ra",
					"expression": "-6..6!0"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:-(a)*(ra)"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "1..3;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "rb",
					"expression": "-6..6!0"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "eval:-(c)*(rb)"
				},
				{
					"name": "ac",
					"expression": "eval:(a)*(c)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["ra < rb"],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Le numérateur ${{a}}x{{b;+}}$ s'annule en $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{ra}}}$ : $B$ y vaut $0$. Le dénominateur ${{c}}x{{d;+}}$ s'annule en $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{rb}}}$ : c'est la **valeur interdite**, marquée d'une double barre.",
					"Le signe d'un quotient suit la même règle que celui d'un produit. Dans chaque colonne, on applique la **règle des signes** : deux signes identiques donnent $+$, deux signes contraires donnent $-$.",
					"```variation\nvariable: x\ndomain: -inf, {{ra}}, {{rb}}, +inf\n\nsign: {{if:a==-1|-|}}{{if:a*a>1|{{a}}|}}x{{b;+}}\n  -inf,{{ra}}: {{if:a>0|-|+}}\n  {{ra}}: z\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: {{if:a>0|+|-}}\n  {{rb}},+inf: {{if:a>0|+|-}}\n\nsign: {{if:c==-1|-|}}{{if:c*c>1|{{c}}|}}x{{d;+}}\n  -inf,{{ra}}: {{if:c>0|-|+}}\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: {{if:c>0|-|+}}\n  {{rb}}: z\n  {{rb}},+inf: {{if:c>0|+|-}}\n\nsign: B(x)\n  -inf,{{ra}}: {{if:ac>0|+|-}}\n  {{ra}}: z\n  {{ra}},{{rb}}: {{if:ac>0|-|+}}\n  {{rb}}: ||\n  {{rb}},+inf: {{if:ac>0|+|-}}\n```"
				]
			}
		},
